{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Lovely and Brave maid-warriors save the Earth from evils&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Angels is an arena shooter survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements in which maid-warriors with various characteristics-a clumsy princess, a genius scientist, a special force-, defeat invading enemies and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid-warriors must survive from waves of enemies and create your own builds by choosing from a variety of weapons and items to defeat the powerful boss at the end of the stage to save peace on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Maid-warriors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/7b59850c1706b6cd181e414470c2b538.avif?t=1772784166\" width=618 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/5311ba66a2ae937d2a215b2ef8b94c7d.poster.avif?t=1772784166\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/5311ba66a2ae937d2a215b2ef8b94c7d.webm?t=1772784166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/5311ba66a2ae937d2a215b2ef8b94c7d.mp4?t=1772784166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clumsy princess, a genius scientist, a special force\u2026 there are various lovely maid-warriors with distinct characteristics, and you will meet more of maid-warriors through gameplay and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A shop sales over 100+ weapons and items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/73a768ade0f79de5a032f38177aae716.poster.avif?t=1772784166\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/73a768ade0f79de5a032f38177aae716.webm?t=1772784166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/73a768ade0f79de5a032f38177aae716.mp4?t=1772784166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a new build for with random choices from the shop between waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no definite walkthroughs. With your own Style or Goal, sweep the enemies in a variety of ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy operation, Increasingly stronger enemies and boss</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/d3ed9a792b480b2241695db4ce76d871.poster.avif?t=1772784166\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/d3ed9a792b480b2241695db4ce76d871.webm?t=1772784166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771600/extras/d3ed9a792b480b2241695db4ce76d871.mp4?t=1772784166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls such as auto-firing weapons and a few buttons for m